{title: 309 - I Surrender All}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #309 • I SURRENDER ALL • 15.15.10.12}
{lyricist: J. W. VanDeVenter}
{composer: W. S. Weeden}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 309}
{meta: tune I SURRENDER ALL}
{meta: meter 15.15.10.12}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]All to Jesus I [A7]surrender; all to [D]Him I freely give;
[A7]I will e-ver [D]love and trust [G/D]him, in [D]His [A7]presence daily live.
[D]I surrender [G/D]all, [D]I [A7]surrender [D]all,
[D]All to thee, my blessed Savior, [A7]I surrender all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[D]I surrender all, I [G/D]surrender [D]all,
[D]all to [A7/G]thee, [G]my [D/A]blessed [A7]Savior,
[D]I surrender all.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]All to Jesus [A7]I surrender;
[A7]humbly [D]at his feet [A7]I bow,
[D]worldly pleasures all [A7]forsaken;
[D]take me, Jesus, [A7]take me now.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]All to Jesus [A7]I surrender;
[A7]make me, [D]Savior, wholly [A7]thine;
[D]fill me with [G/D]thy [D]love [A7]and power;
[D]truly know that [A7]thou art mine.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D]All to Jesus [A7]I surrender;
[A7]now I [D]feel [G/D]the [A7]sacred flame.
[D]O the joy [G/D]of [D]full [A7]salvation!
[D]Glory, glory, [A7]to his name!
{end_of_verse}
